message: "If you use ImagoKit in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "ImagoKit"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Image analysis for electron micrographs in Swift: the calibrated FFT, radial profile, lattice spacings and angles from
  FFT spots, Bragg filtering, HRTEM filters, and drift and stack alignment, checked against NumPy, SciPy and scikit-image.
authors:
  - name: "mac4DSTEM contributors"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/mac4DSTEM/ImagoKit"
keywords:
  - electron microscopy
  - image analysis
  - FFT
  - Swift
